   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## WEB3 Z-Image: fast exploration (text to image)\nZ-Image Turbo for quick drafts: moodboards, testing a direction, trying ten compositions before committing Klein time. Apache 2.0.\n\n- 8 steps, CFG 1, ~6 s at 1 MP once loaded. Natural-language prompts work best.\n- 1.0 MP default; clean up to about 2 MP. Any aspect on the Resolution node.\n- No negative prompt (CFG 1). Say what you want instead: *plain empty background*, *no text*.\n- Picks that make the cut get re-rendered in WEB1 (same prompt) or matched with WEB2.\n- Batch work per model: switching to Klein reloads ~10 GB."
   ]
  },
